Number of changes: 2

1. Added | Private method
   Added `_warn_if_event_writer_is_closed`, which first checks `self._closed` and calls `warnings.warn(...)` with a notification message when the condition is true.

2. Added | Method
   Added `_add_event(self, event, step)`, which first calls `_warn_if_event_writer_is_closed()` and then calls `super(FileWriter, self)._add_event(event, step)`.
